      "sourceTextSha256": "882bdfc67b1c41eaf50c6bef69862257d52395234d5f6fca2fac1bc48bbff796",
      "text": "Private transfer from your hotel to Rio airport, flight to Foz do Iguaçu and a private transfer with a driver only from the airport to your hotel.\n\nThe rest of the day is free.\n\n**Iguazu Falls, Brazil: restaurant dinner and the Rafain show**\n\nYou can add this optional outing.\n\nPrice to be confirmed, minimum 2 people.\n\nThe price includes shared transfers and dinner; drinks are charged separately.",
